{"4523780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MINE ESCAPE", "steam_appid": 4523780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/b5cfce2968e51d33183fc9745143f9c7.poster.avif?t=1785891169\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/b5cfce2968e51d33183fc9745143f9c7.webm?t=1785891169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/b5cfce2968e51d33183fc9745143f9c7.mp4?t=1785891169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINE ESCAPE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped deep underground, players must explore crystal tunnels, gather equipment, and navigate the mine using rail carts while facing the horrors that lurk in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>mine cart is equipped with a machine gun</strong>, allowing you to defend yourself against the threats hiding in the darkness. Teamwork is essential—your friends can become <strong>crystallized by mysterious forces</strong>, and you must free them before it’s too late</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>four unique levels</strong>, each introducing new challenges and dangers. As you progress deeper into the mine, the environment becomes more dangerous and the obstacles more intense, forcing players to work together and think quickly to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play <strong>solo or with friends</strong>, communication and cooperation are key. Use <strong>emotes</strong> to express your feelings, warn teammates, or celebrate survival after escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/69029fac150a6f2add5988e0d97fb8c0.poster.avif?t=1785891169\" width=1170 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/69029fac150a6f2add5988e0d97fb8c0.webm?t=1785891169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/69029fac150a6f2add5988e0d97fb8c0.mp4?t=1785891169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cartrails to transport </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 emotes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crystallize </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/b5cfce2968e51d33183fc9745143f9c7.poster.avif?t=1785891169\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/b5cfce2968e51d33183fc9745143f9c7.webm?t=1785891169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523780/extras/b5cfce2968e51d33183fc9745143f9c7.mp4?t=1785891169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><